        note: 'NOPAT is operating income less the tax provision. Tangible invested capital strips goodwill and intangibles out of invested capital. Tangible ROIC ran 32–35% through FY2012–FY2014, collapsed to 6.7% in the FY2018 tax year, spiked to 51.6% in FY2020, and has compressed to 17.6% in FY2025 as the capex build inflates the denominator.'
